{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [git-history-rewrite]: git filter-repo / filter-branch rewrites history across the entire repository. Confirm explicitly and back up the refs first (git for-each-ref > backup.txt). [command-sha256:5b783e2f09fe00d6dcd6787bb0ddb3fa75697a50a67e328a61e31521fcbf5e4c] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
